## Communication Notes For ChatGPT / Design Team

When giving design feedback, focus on:

- Visual hierarchy.
- Readability at 1366x768 and laptop scale.
- Whether the insights rail feels helpful or crowded.
- Whether Light and Colorful themes feel professional enough.
- How much Nova brand personality is appropriate without feeling like a sci-fi assistant.

When giving product feedback, focus on:

- How a user starts/stops capture.
- How confidently the app communicates recording/transcription status.
- How users review and act on previous meetings.
- Whether the overview popout or an in-app overview page is the better long-term design.

